      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_3021aa7b",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: teenage_goat_meme; hasOverallIntent: harmful; overall-intent-description: The meme juxtaposes an image of two goats mating with the text 'when you catch your teenage goat' and 'having sex for the first time,' creating a crude, sexually suggestive analogy. The intent is to humorously equate a teenage goat's first sexual encounter with a human teenage experience, using animal behavior as a crude metaphor. While not explicitly targeting a specific protected group, the content is vulgar and potentially offensive due to its crude sexualization of animals and implication of adolescent sexuality. The humor relies on shock value and taboo subject matter, which can be considered harmful due to its potential to discomfort or offend viewers, especially those sensitive to animal imagery or adolescent themes. The meme does not contain direct hate or abuse but uses vulgar analogies that may be deemed inappropriate or distasteful.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_d7049eb9"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
