      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_fad12587",
      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the textual material describing a teenage goat's first sexual experience",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'having sex for the first time' in the bottom panel, which is implicitly addressed as 'your' experience. The phrase 'when you catch your teenage goat' in the top text and 'having sex for the first time' in the bottom text together create a deictic projection where the viewer is positioned as the 'you' experiencing the teenage goat's first sexual encounter. This projection is onto the textual material, which frames the user as the subject of the crude metaphor.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
