      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The target community for this meme is individuals who are familiar with crude, taboo-based humor and find shock value in vulgar analogies, particularly those who are comfortable with hypersexualizing animals or adolescent sexuality for comedic effect. The meme relies on its crude metaphor and potentially offensive content to provoke a reaction, suggesting the audience is likely internet-savvy users who appreciate edgy or offensive humor, possibly within online communities that tolerate or encourage such content. The use of the 'teenage goat' as a crude metaphor for human teenage sexual debut indicates the target audience may include adolescents or young adults who are familiar with or find humor in adolescent themes, even when presented in a vulgar or animal-based context.",
